      "content": "i feel like im just disappearing. like i dont even exist anymore outside of what i have to do for everyone else. every single day is just more work, more noise, more nothingness. i look in the mirror and i dont even recognize the person looking back. its just a shell that carries stuff around. i feel so trapped i can barely breathe sometimes.",
